    "`min_labels_per_cell` pooled (25,314) inapita kwa muundo: kila point inapata cells 25, kwa hiyo cells zote zina idadi ile ile. Kigezo chenye meno ni cha cell x symbol x fold \u2014 kimo hapa chini.",
